{"detail": {"templateUuid": "d8e8ad4adf3742c8bbbcd0d0e9f43a9f", "projectUuid": "70bd9ef806f14cac982f0d6033b7033b", "name": "红梅傲雪 共产党万岁！人民万岁！", "description": "庆祝中国共产党成立105周年！ 《红梅傲雪》致敬1932年冬大别山抱儿山战斗中，19岁红军女战士王明玉的真实事迹。部队遭敌包围，她主动留守，在零下十几度的雪地里往返背送20余名重伤员至隐蔽处；返回取药箱时不幸被捕，历经严刑拷打与利诱，最终高呼“共产党万岁 红军万岁”纵身跃入活埋坑。这位19岁的少女在生死关头迸发出惊人的信仰力量。“红梅”是她的精神肖像——风雪愈烈，花朵愈红。\n谨以此片致敬无数如王明玉般湮没于历史的无名英雄。", "coverUrl": "/assets/f93a29169569d54b.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/e3babff6d1484ad1aa25b9bcd8e45640/7f77c0ae850224c2cde984842bd59873cbf5c88f.mp4", "snapshotId": 0, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 2515898, "ownerUuid": "e3babff6d1484ad1aa25b9bcd8e45640", "avatar": "/assets/4edfc4c2dc468209.webp", "nickname": "蒙太神奇", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 58, "tags": [{"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5003, "name": "荣誉", "icon": "/assets/9b8f94fcb073c296.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/deb1579e9091de84.webp", "desc": "LibTV荣誉作者", "verifyLevel": 3}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.douyin.com/user/self?from_tab_name=main&modal_id=7657390199781018926", "createAt": "2026年07月01日 21:33", "updateAt": "2026年07月03日 23:51", "publishAt": "2026年07月01日 21:33", "playCount": 41, "viewCreationProcessCount": 0, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 1}, "recommendList": []}